---

<Base
  title="Education & Speaking — Alexander Zhiganov"
  description="Keynotes, hands-on workshops, and programs on autonomous AI agents, commercial generative video, and interactive technology."
  current="education"
>
  <section class="hero">
    <figure class="hero-media">
      <Image
        src={stagePhoto}
        alt="Alexander Zhiganov delivering a keynote on creative technology and neural production"
        widths={[600, 1000, 1600, 2415]}
        sizes="(max-width: 700px) 500px, (max-width: 1100px) 100vw, 1280px"
        quality={95}
        loading="eager"
        fetchpriority="high"
      />
    </figure>

    <div class="hero-content">
      <div class="hero-panel">
        <h1 class="display hero-title">Education &amp; Speaking</h1>
        <p class="lede hero-lede">
          I teach engineering and creative teams how to build with autonomous agents, generative video, and real-time tech.
        </p>
        <p class="hero-body muted">
          Keynotes and hands-on workshops for conferences, studios, and offsites. Based in Dubai, available worldwide and remotely.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#book">
            Book a Talk or Workshop <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section programs-section" id="programs" aria-labelledby="programs-title">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2 id="programs-title">Speaking &amp; Workshops</h2>
        <p class="section-lead muted">
          Tested formats for conference stages, studio offsites, and technical teams. In-person or remote.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="programs-grid">
        <article class="program-card">
          <div class="card-head">
            <h3 class="card-title">Autonomous AI Agents in Production</h3>
            <p class="card-pitch">
              How teams run autonomous coding agents to build software, automate pipelines, and ship faster with smaller stacks.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="card-meta">
            <div class="meta-row">
              <span class="meta-label">Available Formats:</span>
              <span class="meta-value">Keynote (45 min), Intensive Workshop (2–4 hours), Guest Lecture</span>
            </div>
            <div class="meta-row">
              <span class="meta-label">Target Audience:</span>
              <span class="meta-value">Engineering leads, product managers, creative technologists, startup founders</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="card-takeaways">
            <h4 class="takeaways-title">Key Takeaways</h4>
            <ul class="takeaways-list" role="list">
              <li>Set up autonomous agents with Google Antigravity, Codex, and MCP servers</li>
              <li>Design context boundaries and guardrails so agents don't break production</li>
              <li>Real architectures that moved projects from zero to shipped code</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="card-actions">
            <a
              class="btn btn-card"
              href="#contact"
              aria-label="Book Autonomous AI Agents in Production program"
            >
              Book This Program <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="program-card">
          <div class="card-head">
            <h3 class="card-title">Generative Video in Commercial Production</h3>
            <p class="card-pitch">
              Pipelines for delivering client video with generative tools, from storyboard to broadcast and DOOH billboards.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="card-meta">
            <div class="meta-row">
              <span class="meta-label">Available Formats:</span>
              <span class="meta-value">Keynote (45 min), Studio Workshop (3–4 hours), Masterclass</span>
            </div>
            <div class="meta-row">
              <span class="meta-label">Target Audience:</span>
              <span class="meta-value">Production studios, art directors, motion designers, brand marketers</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="card-takeaways">
            <h4 class="takeaways-title">Key Takeaways</h4>
            <ul class="takeaways-list" role="list">
              <li>Fix flickering and keep characters consistent across cuts</li>
              <li>Multi-GPU render pipelines and upscaling for large formats</li>
              <li>Production breakdown: the Kirigami dance film (3,250 frames) and MAER DOOH campaign</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="card-actions">
            <a class="btn btn-card" href="#contact">
              Book This Program <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="program-card">
          <div class="card-head">
            <h3 class="card-title">Interactive Installations &amp; Real-Time Systems</h3>
            <p class="card-pitch">
              How to build large-scale festival installations and computer vision systems that run reliably in front of live crowds.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="card-meta">
            <div class="meta-row">
              <span class="meta-label">Available Formats:</span>
              <span class="meta-value">Keynote (45 min), Masterclass, Panel Discussion</span>
            </div>
            <div class="meta-row">
              <span class="meta-label">Target Audience:</span>
              <span class="meta-value">Festival curators, experiential agencies, spatial designers, cultural institutions</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="card-takeaways">
            <h4 class="takeaways-title">Key Takeaways</h4>
            <ul class="takeaways-list" role="list">
              <li>Real-time tracking and interaction using OpenCV, WebGL, and depth sensors</li>
              <li>Keep hardware and software running without crashes through 72-hour outdoor festivals</li>
              <li>Case studies from Outline, Intervals, and morning coffeehouse raves</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="card-actions">
            <a
              class="btn btn-card"
              href="#contact"
              aria-label="Book Generative Video in Commercial Production program"
            >
              Book This Program <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section registry-section" id="registry" aria-labelledby="registry-title">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2 id="registry-title">Appearances &amp; Press</h2>
        <p class="section-lead muted">
          Chronological record of keynotes, lectures, research papers, and media coverage from 2023 to 2026.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="registry-filter-bar" role="toolbar" aria-label="Filter track record by category">
        <button type="button" class="filter-btn active" data-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">
          <span>All</span>
          <span class="filter-count">({counts.all})</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="filter-btn" data-filter="talks" aria-pressed="false">
          <span>Keynotes &amp; Talks</span>
          <span class="filter-count">({counts.talks})</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="filter-btn" data-filter="press" aria-pressed="false">
          <span>Media &amp; Press</span>
          <span class="filter-count">({counts.press})</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="filter-btn" data-filter="research" aria-pressed="false">
          <span>Research &amp; Book</span>
          <span class="filter-count">({counts.research})</span>
        </button>
        <span class="sr-only" aria-live="polite" id="filter-status">
          Showing all {counts.all} appearances
        </span>
      </div>

      <div class="table-wrap">
        <table class="registry-table" aria-label="Chronological registry of speaking appearances, lectures, and media features">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th scope="col" class="th-year">Year</th>
              <th scope="col" class="th-platform">Platform / Event</th>
              <th scope="col" class="th-topic">Topic &amp; Narrative Context</th>
              <th scope="col" class="th-format">Format</th>
              <th scope="col" class="th-source">Source</th>
              <th scope="col" class="th-language">Language</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            {registry.map((item) => (
              <tr class="registry-row" data-category={item.category}>
                <td class="td-year">
                  <span class="year-badge">{item.year}</span>
                </td>
                <td class="td-platform">
                  <strong class="platform-name">{item.platform}</strong>
                </td>
                <td class="td-topic">
                  <p class="topic-text">{item.topic}</p>
                </td>
                <td class="td-format">
                  <span class="format-badge">{item.format}</span>
                </td>
                <td class="td-source">
                  <a
                    class="source-link"
                    href={item.url}
                    target="_blank"
                    rel="noopener noreferrer"
                    aria-label={`${item.linkText}: ${item.platform} (opens in new tab)`}
                  >
                    <span>{item.linkText}</span>
                    <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
                  </a>
                </td>
                <td class="td-language">
                  <span class="language-text">{item.language}</span>
                </td>
              </tr>
            ))}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section cta-section" id="book" aria-labelledby="cta-title">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="cta-box">
        <div class="cta-content">
          <h2 class="cta-title" id="cta-title">Book a Talk or Workshop</h2>
          <p class="cta-lead">
            Available for conference keynotes, hands-on workshops, and guest lectures in the UAE and internationally. Reach out to discuss dates and topics.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="cta-actions">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#contact">
            Contact Details <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
          </a>
          <a
            class="btn btn-ghost"
            href="https://t.me/zhiganovsasha"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            aria-label="Contact Alexander directly on Telegram (opens in new tab)"
          >
            Direct on Telegram <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <script>
    function initRegistryFilter() {
      const filterButtons = document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>(
        '.registry-filter-bar .filter-btn'
      );
      const rows = document.querySelectorAll<HTMLTableRowElement>('.registry-row');
      const status = document.getElementById('filter-status');

      if (!filterButtons.length || !rows.length) return;

      filterButtons.forEach((btn) => {
        btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
          const filter = btn.getAttribute('data-filter') || 'all';

          filterButtons.forEach((b) => {
            b.classList.remove('active');
            b.setAttribute('aria-pressed', 'false');
          });
          btn.classList.add('active');
          btn.setAttribute('aria-pressed', 'true');

          let visibleCount = 0;
          rows.forEach((row) => {
            const category = row.getAttribute('data-category');
            if (filter === 'all' || category === filter) {
              row.removeAttribute('hidden');
              visibleCount++;
            } else {
              row.setAttribute('hidden', '');
            }
          });

          if (status) {
            status.textContent = `Showing ${visibleCount} appearances.`;
          }
        });
      });
    }

    if (document.readyState === 'loading') {
      document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', initRegistryFilter);
    } else {
      initRegistryFilter();
    }
  </script>
</Base>

<style>
  /* ---------- HERO ---------- */
  .hero {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    min-height: 720px;
    background: var(--bg-surface);
  }

  .hero-media {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 720px;
    margin: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .hero-media img {
    position: absolute;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: 52% center;
  }

  .hero-content {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-width: 0;
    min-height: 720px;
    padding: 60px clamp(36px, 5vw, 80px);
  }

  .hero-panel {
    width: min(660px, 100%);
  }

  .hero-title {
    max-width: 650px;
  }

  .hero-lede {
    margin-top: 32px;
    font-weight: 550;
    line-height: 1.35;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .hero-body {
    font-size: var(--type-body);
    margin-top: 16px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    max-width: 58ch;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 32px;
  }

  /* ---------- SECTION HEADS ---------- */
  .section-head {
    margin-bottom: clamp(32px, 4vw, 56px);
  }

  .section-head h2 {
    font-size: var(--type-heading);
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .section-lead {
    font-size: var(--type-body);
    margin-top: 14px;
    max-width: 68ch;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  /* ---------- PROGRAMS GRID ---------- */
  .programs-section {
    padding-top: clamp(64px, 8vw, 112px);
    padding-bottom: clamp(64px, 8vw, 112px);
  }

  .programs-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: clamp(20px, 2.5vw, 32px);
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  .program-card {
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    padding: clamp(24px, 2.5vw, 36px);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    transition:
      border-color var(--dur-fast) var(--ease-out),
      transform var(--dur-fast) var(--ease-out);
  }

  .program-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--signal);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .card-head {
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .card-title {
    font-size: var(--type-lead);
    line-height: 1.25;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink);
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .card-pitch {
    font-size: var(--type-body);
    color: var(--mute);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .card-meta {
    background: var(--bg-sunken);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    padding: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .meta-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .meta-label {
    font-size: var(--type-small);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .meta-value {
    font-size: var(--type-small);
    color: var(--mute);
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .card-takeaways {
    flex-grow: 1;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }

  .takeaways-title {
    font-size: var(--type-small);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin: 0 0 10px;
